    "name": "AADS controlled-demo artifacts v1.1.2",
    "body": "## AADS controlled-demo artifacts v1.1.2\n\nCorrected evidence-bound portfolio release for eight crop/part SD-LoRA adapter groups.\n\n- 64 checksum-pinned assets across 8 targets\n- validated crop/part identity across all eight production-readiness records\n- corrected the three misattributed readiness records in v1.1.1\n- frozen controlled-demo result: 48/48 expected decisions\n- independent production-readiness result: 0/8 adapters passed\n\nThe 48-row result is a curated recorded CUDA run, not fresh inference or a field-performance estimate. Every adapter remains `production_ready=false` and `deployable=false`. DINOv3-derived files remain subject to the included DINOv3 license.",
